{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-bcrypt#feature-1","repo":"uckkk/dsh-bcrypt","commit":"f20d3eab213bea65a79340e6363998e28b63facb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bcrypt 的功能「生成密码哈希」：将输入密码转换为带盐哈希，可选 PBKDF2-SHA256 或 scrypt，并返回包含算法、参数、盐和哈希值的字符串。在会话中调用 password_hash 工具，可指定算法和迭代次数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:14-23","lib/index.js:45-66"]}
